{
 "comment": "知识包校验的四侧共用用例：每条给出包（pack 为 JSON 值，packJson 为原文）、可选的底包（builtin 为内嵌默认包）与期望的全部问题；params 给出时逐键比对。由 Rust tests/knowledge_check.rs、Python test_knowledge_check.py、Go knowledge_check_test.go、JS knowledge-check.test.ts 读取。",
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "invalid_json: 非法 JSON",
   "packJson": "{bad",
   "expect": [
    {
     "level": "error",
     "path": [],
     "code": "invalid_json"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "invalid_json 反例: 合法 JSON",
   "packJson": "{\"schema\": 1, \"id\": \"t\", \"version\": \"1\", \"language\": \"zh-CN\"}",
   "expect": []
  },
  {
   "name": "not_object: 数组",
   "pack": [],
   "expect": [
    {
     "level": "error",
     "path": [],
     "code": "not_object",
     "params": {}
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "not_object: null",
   "pack": null,
   "expect": [
    {
     "level": "error",
     "path": [],
     "code": "not_object",
     "params": {}
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "not_object 反例",
   "pack": {
    "schema": 1,
    "id": "t",
    "version": "1",
    "language": "zh-CN"
   },
   "expect": []
  },
